From 0000000000000000000000000000000000000000 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: x <a@b>
Date: Sun, 16 Nov 2026 00:00:00 +0000
Subject: [PATCH] 0980 vince: disable idle sleep (no auto-lock power-off)

The iOS idle sleep path (IOPMrootDomain) turns the system off after the
display auto-locks. On vince this fires ~4.5 min after boot and powers the
device off before the (slow) GUI is usable. Report 0 minutes to idle sleep
so the system never auto-sleeps.
---
 iokit/Kernel/IOPMrootDomain.cpp | 6 ++++++
 1 file changed, 6 insertions(+)

diff --git a/iokit/Kernel/IOPMrootDomain.cpp b/iokit/Kernel/IOPMrootDomain.cpp
--- a/iokit/Kernel/IOPMrootDomain.cpp
+++ b/iokit/Kernel/IOPMrootDomain.cpp
@@ -2145,6 +2145,12 @@ IOPMrootDomain::getAggressiveness(
 	if (!outLevel || (type > UINT_MAX)) {
 		return kIOReturnBadArgument;
 	}
+
+	// VINCE: never idle-sleep (prevents the ~4.5 min auto-lock power-off).
+	if (type == kPMMinutesToSleep) {
+		*outLevel = 0;
+		return kIOReturnSuccess;
+	}
 
 	AGGRESSIVES_LOCK();
